In the HTML code above, replace the `your-image-src-here` placeholder with your actual image source URL.

Then, in your CSS code, apply the `.bounce-img` class to your image element.

That should be it! The animation will now apply to your image, bouncing it up and down repeatedly. 

Feel free to adjust the animation timing and number of bounces to your liking by tweaking the `animation-duration` and `animation-iteration-count` values in the CSS code.

